      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm still not really sure why you keep bringing up goblins though. It's a bit distracting. Could you just explain how I can tell the difference between root rot and a nitrogen deficiency just by looking at the leaves? Like, is there a specific pattern to the yellowing?",
